Third-party material
--------------------

`scripts/sky.js` contains one table of colour values taken from **Calendaria**
by 3 Death Saves (https://github.com/Sayshal/calendaria), used under the MIT
licence: the per-weather sky tints (`HIMMELSTOENUNG`), a strength and three
RGB values for each weather effect.

They are copied rather than reinvented on purpose. The sky behind the rain is
what makes both domes look alike, and a gamemaster running Calendaria sees its
dome next to ours on the table; guessed values would have put two different
skies side by side over the same weather.

